    "title": "Florida Lottery",
    "description": "With the Florida Lottery mobile app, you can check your tickets, view winning numbers and jackpot amounts, find your nearest retailer, enter second chance drawings, and more!\r\n\r\nHere are a few of the features included:\r\n \r\n-\tView current winning numbers and jackpots.\r\n-\tSearch past winning numbers and payouts.\r\n-\tView Scratch-Off game details and remaining prizes.\r\n-\tHow to play instructions for all games.\r\n-\tCheck My Ticket: Scan ticket barcode to determine if you are a winner.\r\n-\tPick Numbers: Create and save your favorite numbers.\r\n-\tShake your phone to select random numbers to play.\r\n-\tFind the nearest Florida Lottery retailer.\r\n-\tEnter second chance drawings.\r\n-\tCustomize notifications for winning numbers and promotional emails.\r\n-\tWatch the Florida Lottery drawings.\r\n-\tCreate and store digital playslips on your device.\r\n-\tScan your digital playslip at a retailer to purchase tickets.\r\n\r\nNote: the Florida Lottery does not accept wagers, bets, or payments of any kind through our mobile app.\r\n \r\nMust be 18 or Older to Play.  Please Play Responsibly.",
